# Optional. Must match BGPMON_API_TOKEN on the server.
#
# Build-time only: this value is inlined into the bundle by `vite build`, so it
# is readable by anyone who can fetch the dashboard's JS. That is acceptable for
# a loopback-bound dashboard behind a reverse proxy, and not acceptable for a
# real per-user identity — see ROADMAP.md "Deployment: enterprise target".
#
# Leave empty when BGPMON_API_TOKEN is empty. The most common failure is setting
# one and not the other, which surfaces as a 401 on every panel.
VITE_API_TOKEN=